# `xs.each.<field>` and `xs.each.<method>(…)`: a field or method of every item, the list's own field unchanged
# (decision each-field-broadcast, card xs-each)
'xs = ["ab", "c"]; xs.each.count'	[2, 1]
'class Counter{count: int}; counters = [Counter{count: 2}, Counter{count: 5}]; sum(counters.each.count)'	7
'xs = ["abc", "cde"]; xs.each.contains("c")'	[yes, yes]
'xs = ["ab", "c"]; xs.count'	2
